WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your back with legs extended and arms alongside the body.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Press the low back gently toward the floor and engage the belly.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Inhale and lift both legs to about 45–90 degrees.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the chin slightly tucked and the shoulders relaxed.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold with even breath, then lower the legs slowly on an exhale.
